  "prefLabel": "Geo 201.01 Applicability of Plc 200",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Geo 201.01 Applicability of Plc 200. The Plc 200 rules shall govern the board of professional geologists with regards to all procedures for:\n\n(a) Adjudicatory proceedings;\n\n(b) Rulemaking submissions, considerations, and disposition of rulemaking petitions;\n\n(c) Public comment hearings;\n\n(d) Declaratory rulings;\n\n(e) All statements of policy and interpretation;\n\n(f) Explanation of adopted rules;\n\n(g) Voluntary surrender of licenses; and\n\n(i) Petitions for waiver of Plc 200 rules.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Geo 200) #13742, eff 9-14-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/geo100-500.html"
